  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2 × 8 ÷ 4 - 5 of 3 + 6 ÷ 3 × 2 - 6 of 3 + 5\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n2 × 8 ÷ 4 - 5 of 3 + 6 ÷ 3 × 2 - 6 of 3 + 5\n\n⇒ 2 × 8 ÷ 4 - 5 × 3 + 6 ÷ 3 × 2 - 6 × 3 + 5\n\n⇒ 2 × 2 - 15 + 2 × 2 - 18 + 5\n\n⇒ 4 - 15 + 4 - 18 + 5\n\n⇒ 4 + 4 + 5 - 15 - 18\n\n⇒ 13 - 33\n\n⇒ -20\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option 1.**",
